  "metadata": {
    "title": "BERT: [CLS] classification and span-based QA",
    "description": "BERT sums token, position, and segment embeddings, then uses a bidirectional encoder. The [CLS] representation feeds a next-sentence classifier; extractive QA uses separate start and end heads and selects the best span with i\u2264j."
  }
